OL,3,GNEWSAWill my life savings be wiped out
OL,4,Aby care costs?
OL,5,
OL,6,FCakes. Holidays. Great music. All
OL,7,Fenjoyable things to think about.
OL,9,FFinancial planning for your end of life
OL,10,Fcare? Not so much.
OL,12,FPerhaps this explains why it can come
OL,13,Fas a major shock when people arrive at
OL,14,Fthe later stages of life, only to see
OL,15,Ftheir savings wiped out by a costly
OL,16,Fcare bill as a result of a stroke,
OL,17,Fdementia or age-related conditions.
