OL,3,GNEWSAWill my life savings be wiped out
OL,4,Aby care costs?
OL,5,
OL,6,FGeorge and Jean Cooke, from Derbyshire,
OL,7,Frecently shared how they had spent more
OL,8,Fthan #60,000 of their own money on
OL,9,Fcontinuing care for 85-year-old George
OL,10,Ffollowing a stroke last year.
